auto-ontology-graph
Copyright 2026 The auto-ontology-graph authors

The table-to-graph mapping reads the database layout of NVIDIA Auto-Ontology
(https://github.com/NVIDIA/auto-ontology, Apache-2.0) and reuses its label and
edge-type names. Parts of the AGE helpers were first written as a prototype in
https://github.com/workdd/auto-ontology/pull/1. No Auto-Ontology code is
imported or redistributed.
